<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= post.title %><%= post.title_ja && String(post.title_ja).trim() ? ' / ' + String(post.title_ja).trim() : '' %> — 포트폴리오</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=20260462">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="inner-page post-detail-page">

  <%- include('partials/inner-header') %>

  <main class="inner-main post-detail-main">
    <div class="inner-container post-container<%= typeof contentAsHtml !== 'undefined' && contentAsHtml ? ' post-container--wide' : '' %>">

      <article class="post-article">
        <header class="post-board-head">
          <% if (post.project_id && post.project_name) { %>
            <a href="/boards/<%= post.project_id %>" class="post-board-name post-board-name--ko"><%= post.project_name %></a>
            <% if (post.project_name_ja != null && String(post.project_name_ja).trim() !== '') { %>
              <a href="/boards/<%= post.project_id %>" class="post-board-name post-board-name--ja" lang="ja"><%= post.project_name_ja %></a>
            <% } %>
          <% } else { %>
            <span class="post-board-name post-board-name--ko">분류 없음</span>
            <span class="post-board-name post-board-name--ja" lang="ja">未分類</span>
          <% } %>
        </header>
        <div class="post-board-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <h1 class="post-heading-title"><%= post.title %></h1>
        <% if (post.title_ja != null && String(post.title_ja).trim() !== '') { %>
          <p class="post-heading-title post-heading-title--ja" lang="ja"><%= post.title_ja %></p>
        <% } %>

        <div class="post-meta-row">
          <div class="post-meta-left">
            <span class="post-meta-author"><%= post.author_nickname && String(post.author_nickname).trim() ? post.author_nickname : '—' %></span>
            <span class="post-meta-times">
              작성 <time datetime="<%= post.created_at %>"><%= typeof postDisplayCreated !== 'undefined' ? postDisplayCreated : '' %></time>
              <% if (typeof postEdited !== 'undefined' && postEdited) { %>
                <span class="post-meta-sep">·</span>
                수정 <time datetime="<%= post.updated_at %>"><%= typeof postDisplayUpdated !== 'undefined' ? postDisplayUpdated : '' %></time>
                <span class="post-edited-pill">(수정됨)</span>
              <% } %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="post-meta-right">
            <span class="post-view-count" aria-label="조회수">조회 <%= post.view_count != null ? post.view_count : 0 %></span>
            <button type="button" class="post-comment-jump" id="postCommentJumpBtn" aria-label="댓글 <%= comments.length %>개, 댓글 영역으로 이동">
              댓글 <%= comments.length %>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="post-content<%= typeof contentAsHtml !== 'undefined' && contentAsHtml ? ' post-content--html' : '' %>">
          <% if (typeof contentAsHtml !== 'undefined' && contentAsHtml) { %>
            <%- post.content %>
          <% } else { %>
            <%- post.content.replace(/\n/g, '<br>') %>
          <% } %>
        </div>

        <% if (isAdmin) { %>
          <div class="post-admin-actions">
            <a href="/posts/<%= post.id %>/edit" class="btn-secondary">
              <i class="fas fa-pen"></i> 수정
            </a>
            <form action="/posts/<%= post.id %>?_method=DELETE" method="POST"
                  class="post-admin-delete-form"
                  onsubmit="return confirm('게시물을 삭제하시겠습니까?')">
              <button type="submit" class="btn-danger">
                <i class="fas fa-trash"></i> 삭제
              </button>
            </form>
            <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" id="postWriteGuideBtn">
              <i class="fas fa-pen-nib"></i> 글쓰기
            </button>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </article>

      <section class="comments-section" id="comments">
        <h2 class="comments-title">댓글 <span class="comment-count"><%= comments.length %></span></h2>

        <% if (comments.length === 0) { %>
          <p class="no-comments">아직 댓글이 없습니다. 첫 댓글을 남겨보세요!</p>
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="comments-list">
            <% comments.forEach(comment => { %>
              <div class="comment-item">
                <div class="comment-header">
                  <span class="comment-author"><%= comment.nickname %></span>
                  <time class="comment-date">
                    <%= new Date(comment.created_at).toLocaleDateString('ko-KR', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %>
                  </time>
                  <% if (isAdmin) { %>
                    <form action="/posts/<%= post.id %>/comments/<%= comment.id %>?_method=DELETE" method="POST"
                          class="inline-form comment-delete"
                          onsubmit="return confirm('댓글을 삭제하시겠습니까?')">
                      <button type="submit" class="btn-delete-sm">삭제</button>
                    </form>
                  <% } %>
                </div>
                <p class="comment-body"><%- comment.content.replace(/\n/g, '<br>') %></p>
              </div>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
        <% } %>

        <% if (user) { %>
          <form action="/posts/<%= post.id %>/comments" method="POST" class="comment-form">
            <div class="comment-form-header">
              <span class="comment-form-user"><%= user.nickname %>으로 댓글 작성</span>
            </div>
            <textarea name="content" class="comment-textarea" rows="3"
                      placeholder="댓글을 입력하세요..." required></textarea>
            <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">댓글 등록</button>
          </form>
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="comment-login-prompt">
            <p>댓글을 작성하려면 <a href="/auth/login?next=/posts/<%= post.id %>">로그인</a>이 필요합니다.</p>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    (function () {
      var jump = document.getElementById('postCommentJumpBtn');
      var target = document.getElementById('comments');
      if (jump && target) {
        jump.addEventListener('click', function () {
          target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
        });
      }
    })();
  </script>
  <% if (isAdmin) { %>
    <% var _newPostQs2 = post.project_id ? ('?project_id=' + post.project_id + '&cancel=' + encodeURIComponent('/posts/' + post.id)) : ('?cancel=' + encodeURIComponent('/posts/' + post.id)); %>
    <dialog id="postWriteGuideDialog" class="post-write-guide-dialog">
      <div class="post-write-guide-inner">
        <h2 class="post-write-guide-title">글쓰기 안내</h2>
        <p class="post-write-guide-title-ja" lang="ja">執筆のご案内</p>
        <% if (post.project_id && post.project_name) { %>
          <p class="post-write-guide-board">
            <span class="post-write-guide-board-ko"><%= post.project_name %></span>
            <% if (post.project_name_ja != null && String(post.project_name_ja).trim() !== '') { %>
              <span class="post-write-guide-board-ja" lang="ja"><%= post.project_name_ja %></span>
            <% } %>
          </p>
        <% } %>
        <% if (post.project_description != null && String(post.project_description).trim() !== '') { %>
          <div class="post-write-guide-desc" lang="ko"><%= String(post.project_description).trim() %></div>
        <% } %>
        <ul class="post-write-guide-list" lang="ko">
          <li>이 게시판 주제에 맞는 내용만 작성해 주세요.</li>
          <li>제목은 국문(필수)과 일본어를 함께 입력하는 것을 권장합니다.</li>
          <li>이미지·동영상은 저작권을 확인한 뒤 첨부해 주세요.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="post-write-guide-list post-write-guide-list--ja" lang="ja">
          <li>この掲示板のテーマに沿った内容でお書きください。</li>
          <li>タイトルは韓国語（必須）と日本語の併記を推奨します。</li>
          <li>画像・動画は著作権を確認のうえ添付してください。</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="post-write-guide-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" id="postWriteGuideClose">닫기</button>
          <a href="/posts/new<%= _newPostQs2 %>" class="btn-primary">새 글 작성하기</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>
    <script>
      (function () {
        var dlg = document.getElementById('postWriteGuideDialog');
        var openBtn = document.getElementById('postWriteGuideBtn');
        var closeBtn = document.getElementById('postWriteGuideClose');
        if (dlg && openBtn) {
          openBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
            if (dlg.showModal) dlg.showModal();
          });
        }
        if (dlg && closeBtn) {
          closeBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
            dlg.close();
          });
        }
      })();
    </script>
  <% } %>
</body>
</html>
